  "description": "Shared core for the Digital Wonderlab community suite (Community Forum, Community Comments): the always-on moderation rules engine, the optional AI-moderation seam, the content sanitiser, the shared settings store, the unified moderation queue and the Community backoffice section. Installed automatically as a dependency of the feature packages.",
