  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.1 - registers the application directory as an additional Razor file provider so the suite's shipped views and partials resolve on a fresh NuGet install. Also, following a pre-release audit: Adds ICommunityOriginResolver, which refuses to build a password-reset or verification link from an unvalidated Host header: set Community:Auth:BaseUrl to your public site URL, or AllowedHosts to a real allow-list, on production. Adds ICommunityErasureService so a member's data is erased across every installed package in the suite from one call. See CHANGELOG.md.",
  "title": "Community Core for Umbraco",
  "verbatimVersion": "1.3.1",
